WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.974 --> 00:00:12.999
Ivy felt bad.

2
00:00:13.019 --> 00:00:15.480
"A skunk sprayed Glen?

3
00:00:16.301 --> 00:00:17.441
That's terrible!"

4
00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:22.524
"Yes," Annie said, "but it was his own fault.

5
00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:26.547
He kept showing off, acting like a wildlife expert."

6
00:00:27.807 --> 00:00:28.468
Ivy nodded.

7
00:00:29.328 --> 00:00:31.549
She could picture exactly what Annie meant.

8
00:00:33.009 --> 00:00:36.210
After everyone returned their trays, Ivy turned to Ezra.

9
00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:39.751
"Glen must be embarrassed about the skunk incident.

10
00:00:40.531 --> 00:00:42.272
Maybe he'll be back to his old self."

11
00:00:43.772 --> 00:00:44.652
Ezra made a face.

12
00:00:44.672 --> 00:00:46.273
"I doubt it!"

13
00:00:48.373 --> 00:00:50.974
The next day Glen wasn't at morning assembly.

14
00:00:52.374 --> 00:00:54.775
After the assembly, Ezra followed Ivy.

15
00:00:54.795 --> 00:00:57.056
"Wait, Ivy!"

16
00:00:57.476 --> 00:00:58.016
Ezra said.

17
00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.721
"Glen's still acting weird.

18
00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:06.225
And now he's upset because he has a nickname—Stinky!"

19
00:01:07.986 --> 00:01:10.008
Ivy couldn't stop herself from grinning.

20
00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:13.190
"It's funny," Ezra said.

21
00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:15.852
"But I'm actually worried about him.

22
00:01:17.153 --> 00:01:18.153
Can you come with me?"

23
00:01:18.173 --> 00:01:27.520
"Sure." They found Glen sitting on his bunk, his head down.

24
00:01:29.124 --> 00:01:30.185
Ivy sniffed the air.

25
00:01:30.205 --> 00:01:32.947
"It smells like skunk in here."

26
00:01:34.188 --> 00:01:34.989
Glen shrugged.

27
00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:38.812
"The nurse gave me something to wash off the skunk spray.

28
00:01:39.673 --> 00:01:42.655
But it still stinks."

29
00:01:42.675 --> 00:01:44.577
"And why weren't you at morning assembly?"

30
00:01:44.997 --> 00:01:45.637
Ivy asked.

31
00:01:45.658 --> 00:01:50.662
"Because I'm never, ever leaving this cabin," Glen said.

32
00:01:50.682 --> 00:01:55.305
"And when camp ends, I'm never, ever coming back."

33
00:01:55.325 --> 00:01:59.373
"But you love Camp Evergreen," Ivy said.

34
00:01:59.393 --> 00:02:01.674
"Not anymore."

35
00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:03.335
Glen shook his head.

36
00:02:03.355 --> 00:02:06.417
"Once I thought I would be a legend.

37
00:02:07.638 --> 00:02:09.840
Now I'm nothing but a joke."

38
00:02:11.221 --> 00:02:13.102
Glen took a sheet of paper off his shelf.

39
00:02:14.443 --> 00:02:17.445
"Ezra, I wrote the comedy routine for you and Wes.

40
00:02:18.986 --> 00:02:20.367
I'm not participating, though.

41
00:02:21.208 --> 00:02:22.889
Everyone's already laughing at me.

42
00:02:26.051 --> 00:02:27.572
Soon Ivy and Ezra left.

43
00:02:29.624 --> 00:02:30.505
Ivy shook her head.

44
00:02:30.525 --> 00:02:33.847
"Glen can't stop coming to camp, Ezra.

45
00:02:34.627 --> 00:02:35.688
He loves it here."

46
00:02:35.708 --> 00:02:37.409
"I know."

47
00:02:38.849 --> 00:02:40.771
Ezra started scanning Glen's script.

48
00:02:40.791 --> 00:02:45.673
"And as bad as Glen feels, he still helped me out.

49
00:02:47.074 --> 00:02:48.675
Some of this is actually funny.

50
00:02:49.456 --> 00:02:50.956
Maybe our act will be okay."

51
00:02:50.976 --> 00:02:55.559
"Hmm." Ivy suddenly had an idea.

52
00:02:55.579 --> 00:02:59.705
"Well, I think my act is about to change."

53
00:03:03.427 --> 00:03:06.409
The night of the talent show, Ivy peeked around the curtain.

54
00:03:07.610 --> 00:03:09.871
Glen was in the crowd, looking miserable.

55
00:03:11.132 --> 00:03:12.392
He hadn't wanted to come.

56
00:03:13.733 --> 00:03:15.774
But Private ordered everyone to attend.

57
00:03:17.475 --> 00:03:20.437
Onstage Wes and Ezra were pretending to argue.

58
00:03:21.518 --> 00:03:25.620
When it was Wes' turn to speak, he tooted his bugle instead of talking.

59
00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.301
"What did you say?"

60
00:03:28.781 --> 00:03:29.481
Ezra yelled.

61
00:03:30.742 --> 00:03:33.203
Wes tooted back, and the crowd laughed.

62
00:03:34.624 --> 00:03:35.965
"That was pretty funny!"

63
00:03:36.425 --> 00:03:37.586
Ivy thought, grinning.

64
00:03:38.826 --> 00:03:41.068
Vampyre was the last group to perform.

65
00:03:42.609 --> 00:03:44.670
Backstage, Willow looked nervous.

66
00:03:44.690 --> 00:03:47.611
"We shouldn't have changed our song.

67
00:03:48.532 --> 00:03:50.213
The first one was great."

68
00:03:50.233 --> 00:03:54.135
"The new act is fine," Clara said.

69
00:03:54.155 --> 00:03:56.256
"And we're doing a good deed.

70
00:03:57.064 --> 00:03:58.245
People will love it!"

71
00:03:58.265 --> 00:04:05.471
"As long as I remember the dance steps," Ivy thought, walking onstage.

72
00:04:06.772 --> 00:04:07.813
She looked at the crowd.

73
00:04:07.833 --> 00:04:13.117
"This song is for someone we all know Glen!"

74
00:04:15.779 --> 00:04:18.641
We know a guy, Some called him a zero.

75
00:04:19.542 --> 00:04:22.645
But we don't lie, He's really a hero.

76
00:04:23.525 --> 00:04:26.948
He helps his friends, He saved Mango, too, Yeah!

77
00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:27.800
Shout out to Glen!

78
00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:43.507
He's a hero, The crowd jumped to their feet, clapping and laughing.

79
00:04:44.907 --> 00:04:47.088
Then Private walked onstage with a trophy.

80
00:04:47.108 --> 00:04:50.830
"First place goes to Vampyre.

81
00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.631
The audience loved your act."

82
00:04:56.692 --> 00:04:58.834
Clara took the trophy and they all bowed.

83
00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:02.136
Glen rushed up to them, grinning.

84
00:05:02.156 --> 00:05:05.298
"That is such a cool song!"

85
00:05:05.318 --> 00:05:08.740
"Ivy wrote it," Clara said.

86
00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:12.022
"Thanks, Ivy," Glen said.

87
00:05:12.042 --> 00:05:15.145
"I guess I have some good friends here."

88
00:05:16.245 --> 00:05:17.286
He lowered his voice.

89
00:05:17.306 --> 00:05:20.548
"But nobody really called me a 'zero.'

90
00:05:20.848 --> 00:05:21.269
Did they?"

91
00:05:21.289 --> 00:05:23.690
"No," Ivy said.

92
00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.812
"Because you're number one.

93
00:05:26.308 --> 00:05:27.230
Right, Stinky?"
